ist_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6004,"order":25,"text_geez":"","text_am":"14. የቅዱስ ዲዮስቆሮስ ቅዳሴ","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-25","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6005,"order":26,"text_geez":"","text_am":"ከዚህ በታች በየስማቸውና አርስታቸው የተዘረዘሩት በታላላቅ ገዳማት፣ አድባራት፣ ቤተመዘክር አንዳ ሉ ቢታወቅም በአንድ ጥራዝ ላይ ታትመው ለአገልግሎት ሲውሉ አይታዩም። ይህም ወደፊት ጥናታ ዊ ማብራሪያ ስለምንሰጥበት በዚሁ አልፈነዋል።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-26","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6006,"order":27,"text_geez":"","text_am":"15. የአመቤታችን ቅዳሴ ቁጥር 2 (በአባ ጊዮርጊስ ዘጋስጫ)","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-27","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6007,"order":28,"text_geez":"","text_am":"16. የቅዱስ ማርቆስ ቅዳሴ","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-28","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6008,"order":29,"text_geez":"","text_am":"17. የቅዱስ ያዕቆብ ቅዳሴ (ሐዋርያዉ)","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-29","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6009,"order":30,"text_geez":"","text_am":"18. የአመቤታችን ቅዳሴ ቁጥር 3 (ጎርጎርዮስ)","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-30","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6010,"order":31,"text_geez":"","text_am":"19. የአመቤታችን ቅዳሴ ቁጥር 4 (ጎርጎርዮስ)","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-31","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6011,"order":32,"text_geez":"","text_am":"20. የቅዱስ ቄርሎስ ቅዳሴ (ቁጥር ሚ)","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-32","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:list_item","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6012,"order":33,"text_geez":"","text_am":"በፍሬ ቅዳሴ ብዛት ኦሪየንታል ከሚባሉት አብያት ክርሰቲያናት የመጀመሪያውን ደረጃ የያዘችው የሶር ያ ቤተክርስቲያን ስትሆን ኢትዮጵያ ሀገራችን በሚኛ ደረጃ ትገኛለች።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-33","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6013,"order":34,"text_geez":"","text_am":"ፍሬ ቅዳሴዎች የተጻፉበት ቅደም ተከተልና ጸሐፊዎቹ በአርግጠኛነት ለማወቅ ባይቻልም በቀደምትነ ት የሚታወቁት የሐዋርያት ቅዳሴ አና የጌታ ቅዳሴ ናቸው፤ (ቁጥር 1 አና ሚ) የቅዱስ ባስልዮስ ቅዳሴ (ረ) ከውጭ የተወሰዱ ለመሆናቸዉ ጥርጥር የለውም።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-34","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6014,"order":35,"text_geez":"","text_am":"የተቀሩት ቅዳሴዎች ምንም አንኳን ደራሲዎቻቸው በሐዋርያት አና በቅዱሳን ስም ቢሆኑም የኢትዮጵ ያን አባቶቻችን ድርሰቶች አንደሆኑ የተደረጉት ጥናቶች ያመለክታሉ። የኢትዮጵያን አባቶቻችን ድር ሰታቸው የራሳቸው መሆኑን ያልገለጹበት ምክኒያት ክብራቸዉ ይገለጥ ዘንድ ስለማይፈልጉና ተቀባይነ ት አንዲኖረው ለማድረግ ጭምር ነው። አለበለዚያም ከውጭ የተገኙት ላይ መሠረት አደርገው አስ ፋፋተው የጻፉት ነው ምክኒያቱም በአነዚህ አንዳንድ አባቶች ስም የተጻፉት ቅዳሴዎች በሌሎች ሀገ ር ከሚገናኙት ጋር ሲነጻጻር ተመሳሳይነት የላቸውም።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-35","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6015,"order":36,"text_geez":"","text_am":"ቅዳሴ የምስጋና ሁሉ ምደምደሚያ (ማሰሪያ) በመሆኑ አያንዳንዳችን በቤተክርስቲያን ተገኝተን የጸሎ ቱ ተሳታፊ በመሆን ለአኛ ኃጢአት በቀራንዮ የተሰቀለውን የክርስቶስን ሥጋውና ደሙን ልንቀበልና የ ክብሩ ወራሾች ልንሆን ይገባል። ሥጋውና ደሙ የሚፈተተዉ ለሕጻናትና ሸማግሎች ብቻ ሳይሆን ከ 40 አና ከሩመ ቀን ጀምሮከመንፈስ ቅዱስ ልጅነት ላገኙ በሁሉም አድሜ ክልል ላሉ ነው።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-36","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6016,"order":37,"text_geez":"","text_am":"ስለዚህ ለሠራነውን ኃጢአት ንስሐ አየገባን ሥጋውን ደሙን ለመቀበል ጸሎተ ቅዳሴው ከመጀምሩ በ ፊት በቤተ ክርስቲያን በመገኘት በሥርዐተ ቅዳሴው አና በፍሬ ቅዳሴው የሚነበቡትን ምስጢራት ልና ስተውል ልንረዳ ይገባል። በምናስቀድስበትም ጊዜ ከመሰቀሉ በፊት በዕለተ ሓሙስ የሠራልንን ሥርዐ ት አንዲሁም ለአኛ ለሰው ልጆች በዕለተ ዓርብ በቀራንዮ ተሰቅሎ ሥጋውን የቆረሰልን፣ደሙን ያፈሰ ሰልንን መሆኑን አያሰብን የሠራነውንም ኃጢአት አንዲያስተሰርይልን ሊሆን ይገባል። ይህንንም አንፈ ጽም ዘንድ የልዑል አግዚአብሔር ፈቃድ ከአኛ ጋር ይሁን።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-37","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6017,"order":38,"text_geez":"","text_am":"ስለ ሥጋውና ደሙ ሥርዐት፣ አንዴት ልንቀበለው አንደሚገባን ምስጢረ �ርባንን ይመልከቱ።","text_en":"","role":"reader","source_page":2,"source_part":"entry-38","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6018,"order":39,"text_geez":"","text_am":"ዋቢ መጻሕፍት","text_en":"","role":"rubric","source_page":3,"source_part":"entry-39","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:heading","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6019,"order":40,"text_geez":"","text_am":"መጽሐፈ ቅዳሴ","text_en":"","role":"rubric","source_page":3,"source_part":"entry-40","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:heading","source_note":"source_language=amharic","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6020,"order":41,"text_geez":"","text_am":"","text_en":"E. Hammerschmidt, Studies in the Ethiopic Anaphoras, Berlin 1961.","role":"reader","source_page":3,"source_part":"entry-41","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=english","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6021,"order":42,"text_geez":"","text_am":"","text_en":"The Divine Liturgy According to the Rite of the Ethiopian Church, Paulos Tzadua","role":"reader","source_page":3,"source_part":"entry-42","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=english","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6022,"order":43,"text_geez":"","text_am":"","text_en":"The Church of Ethiopia, A publication of the Ethiopian Orthodox Church , Addis Ababa, December 1970.","role":"reader","source_page":3,"source_part":"entry-43","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:paragraph","source_note":"source_language=english","source_needs_review":true},{"id":6023,"order":44,"text_geez":"","text_am":"","text_en":"January 2004","role":"rubric","source_page":3,"source_part":"entry-44","source_kind":"liturgy-guide:heading","source_note":"source_language=english","source_needs_review":true}]}]}}